WEBVTT

00:00.690 --> 00:03.400
Oh! Usato, Suzune!

00:03.810 --> 00:05.590
Glad to see you both safe and sound.

00:05.590 --> 00:07.820
I apologize for causing you undue worry.

00:07.820 --> 00:10.200
No, we should be the ones to apologize.

00:10.200 --> 00:12.280
That must have not been easy.

00:12.280 --> 00:15.080
Usato, I apologize for getting
you mixed up in all this.

00:15.080 --> 00:17.490
Oh, no, I'm fine.

00:17.490 --> 00:19.750
I'm more than used to
being in situations like those.

00:20.210 --> 00:21.130
You're "used to"?

00:22.210 --> 00:24.050
I-I shouldn't have said that!

00:26.090 --> 00:28.010
Yes, for you see...

00:28.010 --> 00:31.010
back in my old world,
I often went trekking in the woods.

00:31.010 --> 00:33.260
Oh, that's what you meant.

00:33.260 --> 00:34.810
By the way, Usato...

00:35.640 --> 00:38.560
How's your Rescue Squad training going?

00:38.560 --> 00:39.520
Huh?

00:39.520 --> 00:42.020
That's a tough one to answer!

00:44.150 --> 00:47.740
I-It's been nothing but smooth sailing!

00:50.030 --> 00:51.610
Smooth sailing, you say?

00:51.990 --> 00:53.280
That's good to hear.

00:53.280 --> 00:54.400
Y-Yup!

00:57.700 --> 00:58.470
That expression!

00:58.470 --> 01:00.730
It's as if I said exactly
what she wanted me to say!

01:00.730 --> 01:05.000
Have I been conditioned by Rose
on a psychological level as well?

01:05.000 --> 01:06.590
That's so annoying!

01:06.930 --> 01:10.510
We will rearrange Suzune's training.

01:10.870 --> 01:13.180
Please, rest well today.

01:13.180 --> 01:15.180
We will. Thank you.

01:15.930 --> 01:17.640
The two of you are dismissed.

01:17.640 --> 01:20.270
Rose, Siglis,
could the two of you remain behind?

01:20.570 --> 01:21.520
Of course.

01:21.520 --> 01:22.330
Very well.

01:38.540 --> 01:43.210
THE WRONG WAY TO USE HEALING MAGIC

02:56.320 --> 02:59.240
#6 DANGER APPROACHES...!

02:59.240 --> 03:01.160
Usato-kun, something wrong?

03:01.160 --> 03:02.580
Oh, no.

03:02.580 --> 03:06.580
I was just wondering
what they're talking about.

03:06.580 --> 03:10.420
That minister guy's face was rather grave.

03:10.420 --> 03:13.380
Oh, Sergio-san?
I guess you're right.

03:13.380 --> 03:15.840
Are they going to fire us or something?

03:15.840 --> 03:18.930
Nah, I don't think so.

03:18.930 --> 03:20.530
Usato! Senpai!

03:21.100 --> 03:23.770
Please wait up, Kazuki-sama!

03:25.180 --> 03:27.480
It's Kazuki! Long time no see!

03:27.480 --> 03:28.750
Celia-sama, too!

03:28.750 --> 03:30.900
You're being far too casual!

03:30.900 --> 03:33.350
You guys were attacked
by monsters and went missing!

03:33.350 --> 03:35.530
Do you have any idea
how worried I was?

03:35.530 --> 03:38.110
Sorry, I didn't realize...

03:38.430 --> 03:41.660
Kazuki-sama was all but ready
to dash out of the castle!

03:41.660 --> 03:44.040
He was going to find
the two of you himself.

03:45.160 --> 03:48.040
You sure are reckless,
aren't you, Kazuki-kun?

03:48.040 --> 03:50.750
Reckless? You're one to talk...

03:50.750 --> 03:52.590
You were even bitten
by that little monkey.

03:52.590 --> 03:55.210
U-Usato-kun! That's not fair!

03:55.210 --> 03:57.630
Usato... what little monkey?

03:57.630 --> 03:58.750
Well, you see, Inu—

03:58.750 --> 04:01.550
I-It's nothing! Nothing at all!

04:01.550 --> 04:03.720
Right? Usato-kun?

04:05.930 --> 04:08.600
Huh? That's what the captain said?

04:08.600 --> 04:11.270
Yup. That the two of you
will be just fine.

04:11.270 --> 04:14.150
And that you're not
going to die that easily.

04:14.150 --> 04:16.440
She sure calmed me down.

04:16.440 --> 04:17.690
I bet she was thinking,

04:17.690 --> 04:20.320
"He's having it on Easy Mode
compared to my training.

04:20.320 --> 04:22.620
There's no way he's going to die."

04:23.010 --> 04:26.290
Rose-san had complete faith in you.

04:26.290 --> 04:28.540
I was in awe.

04:28.940 --> 04:31.790
To take her words at face value...

04:31.790 --> 04:35.550
Kazuki... what a pure, sweet,
innocent boy you are.

04:35.960 --> 04:39.090
Never change, Kazuki.

04:39.090 --> 04:41.760
Only Senpai and I need to be tainted.

04:42.930 --> 04:43.930
All right...

04:43.930 --> 04:46.390
I have no idea what you're
talking about, but okay.

04:46.710 --> 04:49.730
He's calling me tainted right to my face!

04:49.730 --> 04:51.310
What's that about?!

04:51.310 --> 04:53.650
Tell me, what do you mean?!

04:53.650 --> 04:56.190
N-No, Senpai, that was just
a figure of speech!

04:56.650 --> 04:59.030
See you later, Usato!

04:59.030 --> 05:01.030
See you at practice tomorrow, Senpai!

05:01.030 --> 05:02.950
Please have a good rest.

05:02.950 --> 05:03.910
Will do!

05:03.910 --> 05:05.910
Later, Kazuki-kun, Celia!

05:05.910 --> 05:06.790
See ya!

05:08.580 --> 05:11.040
The two of them are
really close, aren't they?

05:11.040 --> 05:12.750
Senpai and Usato?

05:12.750 --> 05:15.840
Yup. Recently,
they've gotten even closer.

05:15.840 --> 05:18.590
No, I meant close to you.

05:20.050 --> 05:23.720
Kazuki-sama, you looked like
you were really enjoying yourself.

05:24.080 --> 05:27.890
Oh, that's because we were
already friends before coming here.

05:30.850 --> 05:32.140
Celia-san?

05:33.940 --> 05:37.400
Could I be one of your friends, too?

05:38.280 --> 05:42.410
Suzune-sama calls me Celia.

05:42.820 --> 05:46.490
Would it be too much if...
I asked you to call me Celia, too?

05:49.830 --> 05:51.620
I apologize, Kazuki-sama.

05:51.620 --> 05:53.460
You don't have to force yourself...

05:53.700 --> 05:55.120
N-No, not at all.

05:55.630 --> 05:58.550
Very well. I will call you
Celia from now on.

05:58.960 --> 06:00.010
How's that?

06:01.340 --> 06:02.550
Thank you!

06:04.010 --> 06:06.220
Now then... let's get down to business.

06:06.580 --> 06:11.180
We have interrogated the bandits
who attacked Usato's group.

06:11.180 --> 06:12.060
Sergio.

06:12.060 --> 06:13.060
Yes, Your Majesty.

06:13.060 --> 06:16.400
When the bandits were crossing the plains,

06:16.400 --> 06:19.320
they noticed far fewer
monsters than normal.

06:19.650 --> 06:24.780
Right after, they were attacked by
a herd of Fall Boars in the forest.

06:25.700 --> 06:28.370
If what they said is true,

06:28.370 --> 06:32.040
then the monsters must be
fleeing the plains for the forest.

06:32.040 --> 06:35.330
Fleeing from something terrible...

06:36.000 --> 06:37.250
headed this way.

06:37.550 --> 06:39.710
The Demon Lord's Army?

06:40.090 --> 06:42.420
I believe so.

06:42.860 --> 06:44.760
They're making their way here...

06:45.260 --> 06:46.350
finally.

06:48.350 --> 06:52.390
Unlike during our previous battle,
they won't underestimate us again.

06:52.890 --> 06:56.480
They will use everything at their
disposal to capture our kingdom.

06:57.020 --> 06:59.320
Indeed... they will.

06:59.730 --> 07:02.490
Siglis, relay this message
to all the commanding officers.

07:02.490 --> 07:05.280
Be ready to mobilize
the troops at any time.

07:05.280 --> 07:07.530
Consider it done, Your Majesty.

07:07.530 --> 07:09.120
I will head out at once.

07:09.120 --> 07:12.330
Sergio, inform the other ministers.

07:12.330 --> 07:13.580
Yes, Your Majesty.

07:16.750 --> 07:18.550
I apologize for the wait, Rose.

07:18.550 --> 07:20.540
I have something to request from you, too.

07:21.170 --> 07:25.630
I wouldn't normally assign this mission
to the captain of the Rescue Squad, but...

07:25.630 --> 07:27.970
Not a problem, Lloyd-sama.

07:28.510 --> 07:32.390
You want me to see how far
the Demon Lord's Army has come, right?

07:32.690 --> 07:34.560
Precisely.

07:34.560 --> 07:35.690
I am sorry.

07:36.010 --> 07:37.600
Don't be.

07:37.600 --> 07:41.610
I'm well aware that
I'm the fastest in the kingdom.

07:41.610 --> 07:43.150
If that is all...

07:43.150 --> 07:44.650
One more thing.

07:50.780 --> 07:52.010
Rose...

07:52.010 --> 07:54.870
will you consider returning to your post
as battalion commander?

07:55.540 --> 07:57.250
No, I will not.

07:58.120 --> 08:01.810
I bear more guilt than you think.

08:02.500 --> 08:07.300
You were the first healer to be
appointed as battalion commander.

08:07.300 --> 08:09.850
Why do you criticize yourself so?

08:10.320 --> 08:11.800
It's not self-loathing.

08:12.390 --> 08:13.970
It's the truth.

08:14.810 --> 08:17.390
You haven't forgiven yourself, have you?

08:17.750 --> 08:20.230
No, I have not.

08:20.230 --> 08:21.940
How could I forget?

08:22.860 --> 08:25.190
I've accepted the deaths
of all my subordinates

08:25.190 --> 08:29.240
and the fact that no amount
of healing will bring them back.

08:30.110 --> 08:32.990
The scar that has been
carved into my right eye

08:32.990 --> 08:35.039
will never let me forget them.

08:35.340 --> 08:37.830
But that is not your burden to bear.

08:37.830 --> 08:39.710
It is my burden to bear!

08:40.070 --> 08:42.919
They died because
I was too full of myself.

08:43.840 --> 08:46.170
That is when I realized.

08:46.170 --> 08:48.010
That no matter how skilled you are...

08:48.010 --> 08:50.050
that no matter how trustworthy you are...

08:50.050 --> 08:51.970
it's all over when you're dead.

08:52.670 --> 08:54.760
This scar is my punishment.

08:54.760 --> 08:57.270
It will never let me forget my sins.

08:59.520 --> 09:02.310
That is why I created the Rescue Squad.

09:02.310 --> 09:06.110
Not to fight,
but to focus on saving lives.

09:07.610 --> 09:08.740
Indeed...

09:09.130 --> 09:13.530
The Rescue Squad saved a great
many men during the battle two years ago.

09:13.530 --> 09:17.450
Have you not already achieved your goal?

09:17.450 --> 09:22.170
No, there is another reason
the Rescue Squad exists.

09:22.170 --> 09:23.830
...and that is?

09:23.830 --> 09:25.840
I want to find...

09:25.840 --> 09:27.760
a subordinate who will not die.

09:27.760 --> 09:28.840
Wha...

09:28.840 --> 09:32.590
That's not something humanly possible!

09:32.880 --> 09:35.180
That's what all the training is for.

09:35.180 --> 09:38.590
Healing magic, the determination
to push one's body beyond its limits,

09:38.590 --> 09:41.520
and an iron will that will never bend
in the face of any opponent.

09:42.220 --> 09:43.940
I've been searching all this time...

09:43.940 --> 09:46.480
for someone who has all three.

09:46.480 --> 09:47.650
...and that's Usato.

09:48.150 --> 09:50.570
Usato has everything
I've been looking for.

09:50.990 --> 09:55.280
Survival instincts, adaptability,
and the will to live.

09:55.280 --> 09:57.220
At best, he's someone who hates to lose.

09:57.220 --> 10:01.750
At worst, he's someone who's easily
influenced by those around him.

10:01.750 --> 10:04.710
On top of that, no matter what I do,

10:04.710 --> 10:08.170
he keeps standing up to me.

10:08.170 --> 10:09.750
He will never give up.

10:10.150 --> 10:11.510
It's as if...

10:12.590 --> 10:13.380
That's right.

10:13.380 --> 10:17.430
He's a cheeky brat who reminds me
of the guys who are no longer with us.

10:17.930 --> 10:22.770
That is why I'm determined
to make him the ideal healer.

10:24.770 --> 10:26.150
My apologies.

10:26.150 --> 10:28.020
I spoke out of turn.

10:28.310 --> 10:30.360
I will head to the border at once.

10:30.360 --> 10:32.190
I am counting on you.

10:36.780 --> 10:39.160
Oh? Alec, what's this?

10:39.160 --> 10:41.080
This is for me, isn't it?

10:41.370 --> 10:46.500
Big Sis left it there for ya
when yer were feedin' Blurin.

10:46.500 --> 10:48.420
This doesn't bode well...

10:52.760 --> 10:55.300
No training tomorrow.

10:55.300 --> 10:58.510
Instead, deliver the enclosed letter here.

10:58.840 --> 11:01.390
So, where did the captain go?

11:01.390 --> 11:02.600
Who knows?

11:02.600 --> 11:05.770
All she said was that she ain't
gonna be needin' dinner.

11:13.820 --> 11:15.950
The bridge is almost complete!

11:15.950 --> 11:16.740
Keep up the pace!

11:17.090 --> 11:19.370
We are the Demon Lord's spear!

11:19.370 --> 11:21.970
Work your bodies to the bone
in service of the Demon Lord!

11:22.660 --> 11:23.830
Not again...

11:24.250 --> 11:25.790
What is it, Black Knight?

11:25.790 --> 11:27.290
Something you want to say?

11:27.670 --> 11:30.590
You're being way too
enthusiastic about all this.

11:30.590 --> 11:32.090
Frankly, it's annoying.

11:32.710 --> 11:34.340
How dare you?!

11:34.340 --> 11:37.340
That is no way to talk
to your superior officer!

11:37.340 --> 11:39.300
Oh, I'm so sorry.

11:39.300 --> 11:43.600
We were all pretty much
equal in the Second Army.

11:44.310 --> 11:48.730
I don't care. As of now,
you're under my command.

11:48.730 --> 11:51.020
You best obey my every order.

11:51.020 --> 11:52.940
Sure, sure. Whatever you say.

11:53.320 --> 11:55.360
Just call me when the bridge is ready.

11:57.240 --> 11:59.160
You look like you're struggling.

11:59.160 --> 12:00.620
What do you want, Hyriluk?

12:00.620 --> 12:02.660
Come to laugh at me?

12:02.660 --> 12:04.620
My, my, aren't you on edge today?

12:04.620 --> 12:06.830
I'm just here to give you moral support.

12:06.830 --> 12:09.750
The bridge construction...
looks to be coming along just fine.

12:09.750 --> 12:12.290
Indeed. It will be finished
in a few more hours.

12:12.670 --> 12:14.380
Then, it can finally begin.

12:14.380 --> 12:17.550
Our invasion of the Llinger Kingdom!

12:17.550 --> 12:18.720
Commander!

12:18.720 --> 12:20.430
There's someone on the other side!

12:20.720 --> 12:22.140
An enemy scout?

12:22.390 --> 12:23.930
Almost certainly!

12:23.930 --> 12:25.560
Leave them be.

12:25.560 --> 12:29.980
By the time they've spread
the word, we'll already be...

12:36.240 --> 12:37.070
What happened?!

12:37.740 --> 12:41.410
I think a tree trunk came
flying from the other side...

12:41.410 --> 12:43.660
A tree trunk?!
From that distance?!

12:53.420 --> 12:56.920
Damn you, Rose!

12:57.670 --> 13:00.130
This was supposed to be
a reconnaissance mission.

13:00.680 --> 13:04.430
Oh, well. I was at least able
to buy us a couple of days.

13:06.390 --> 13:09.230
Hmm... am I going in the right direction?

13:09.640 --> 13:12.100
I have to say,
this is a very detailed map.

13:12.400 --> 13:13.980
Did Rose draw this?

13:13.980 --> 13:16.280
Is she actually capable
of being this meticulous?

13:16.560 --> 13:17.440
Look at that guy!

13:17.440 --> 13:19.700
Wait, he's a member of
the Rescue Squad, isn't he?

13:20.470 --> 13:23.030
Are people staring at me?

13:23.030 --> 13:25.120
But I didn't even bring
Blurin along today...

13:25.450 --> 13:27.330
Why's he just walking normally?

13:27.330 --> 13:28.540
I wonder why...

13:28.540 --> 13:31.620
I'm drawing more attention
by not doing anything weird?

13:31.620 --> 13:32.960
What's up with that?

13:33.250 --> 13:34.880
Oh, it's you!

13:34.880 --> 13:37.170
Oh, good afternoon!

13:37.170 --> 13:40.010
The little blue guy not with you today?

13:40.010 --> 13:41.670
How about some of his favorite fruits?

13:41.670 --> 13:44.410
Just got a fresh batch in today!

13:44.410 --> 13:46.080
Yes, please!

13:46.080 --> 13:48.720
But I have somewhere to be.
I'll pick them up on the way back.

13:48.720 --> 13:50.640
Not a problem! I'll be waiting!

13:53.770 --> 13:55.310
Is this the place?

13:56.190 --> 13:58.360
Excuse me!

13:58.860 --> 14:00.440
I'll be right there!

14:01.490 --> 14:02.610
Good afternoon!

14:02.610 --> 14:04.070
How may I help...

14:04.070 --> 14:05.530
A Rescue Squad member?

14:05.530 --> 14:07.120
Oh, I know!

14:07.580 --> 14:10.580
You're the one who just joined,
aren't you?!

14:10.580 --> 14:12.620
Yes, I'm...

14:12.620 --> 14:14.170
Wait! Don't say a thing.

14:14.170 --> 14:16.710
Onii-chan told me your name!

14:16.710 --> 14:19.170
What was it again?

14:19.170 --> 14:21.880
It was something like Usagi...

14:21.880 --> 14:23.340
No, that's not it.

14:23.340 --> 14:24.260
Tanuki!

14:24.260 --> 14:25.050
Squirrel!

14:25.050 --> 14:25.970
Cat!

14:25.970 --> 14:27.140
It's Usato...

14:27.140 --> 14:29.350
That's it! Usato-kun!

14:29.350 --> 14:31.890
Oh, and I'm Ururu Fleur.

14:31.890 --> 14:33.350
I'm 18!

14:33.350 --> 14:34.520
What about you?

14:34.520 --> 14:36.860
I'm 17...

14:36.860 --> 14:38.650
One year younger, huh?

14:38.650 --> 14:39.570
Y-Yeah.

14:39.910 --> 14:42.820
E-er, you're Orga-san's
younger sister, right?

14:42.820 --> 14:44.740
You're a healer, too?

14:44.740 --> 14:45.740
Yup!

14:45.740 --> 14:50.200
And you're standing in Fleur Clinic!
It's run by me and my brother.

14:50.200 --> 14:51.790
Welcome!

14:51.790 --> 14:53.370
I-I see...

14:53.370 --> 14:55.170
...and where's Orga-san?

14:55.610 --> 14:58.960
He's examining a patient.

14:58.960 --> 15:00.550
Wanna see?

15:00.550 --> 15:01.920
C-Can I?

15:01.920 --> 15:04.340
Of course! Just follow me.

15:06.010 --> 15:09.510
W-Why does it feel like
we're sneaking a peek?

15:09.510 --> 15:13.680
Quiet! Onii-chan needs to concentrate!

15:13.680 --> 15:14.770
Right...

15:22.610 --> 15:25.490
The color is so intense,
and the flow is so smooth!

15:25.880 --> 15:28.200
Completely unlike mine!

15:37.460 --> 15:39.750
There, all done.
How do you feel?

15:43.300 --> 15:45.260
I don't feel sick anymore!

15:45.260 --> 15:46.760
I'm all better, Mama!

15:47.510 --> 15:49.800
Thank you so much, Sensei!

15:49.800 --> 15:52.140
My pleasure!

15:52.140 --> 15:56.060
Hey, Sensei, who are those guys?

15:58.310 --> 15:59.480
Usato-kun!

16:01.190 --> 16:03.230
I see. A letter from Rose-san?

16:03.530 --> 16:05.150
Thank you for coming all this way.

16:05.150 --> 16:10.240
No, no. I've been meaning
to pop by your clinic one day.

16:10.240 --> 16:11.870
Hey, hey, Usato-kun!

16:11.870 --> 16:14.290
How are the Rescue Squad guys doing?

16:14.290 --> 16:15.830
You mean Tong and the others?

16:16.100 --> 16:18.250
They're all still sporting bad-guy faces.

16:19.710 --> 16:22.130
That means they're doing fine!

16:22.130 --> 16:25.760
I really miss Alec's cooking!

16:25.760 --> 16:26.760
Oh, that's right!

16:26.760 --> 16:29.010
You're part of the Rescue Squad, too!

16:29.010 --> 16:29.840
Yup!

16:29.840 --> 16:33.890
Unlike you, I just couldn't keep up
with the training...

16:33.890 --> 16:35.770
Why did you quit?

16:35.770 --> 16:36.680
Well...

16:36.680 --> 16:39.230
I might not be as good as Onii-chan,

16:39.230 --> 16:42.190
but I'm also better at healing others.

16:42.190 --> 16:44.320
But the biggest reason is that

16:44.320 --> 16:46.780
I didn't want to worry Onii-chan.

16:49.280 --> 16:50.360
Guilty as charged!

16:51.160 --> 16:53.700
But I do feel bad...

16:53.700 --> 17:00.250
When we first joined,
Rose-san put everything into training us.

17:01.500 --> 17:04.589
It was right after she started
the Rescue Squad.

17:04.589 --> 17:07.550
We were really pumped about it, too.

17:08.339 --> 17:10.300
But it didn't work out.

17:10.300 --> 17:13.260
Not only could I not keep up,

17:13.260 --> 17:16.430
but I also became
really afraid of Rose-san.

17:16.819 --> 17:21.099
Back then, it was like she was desperate.

17:21.099 --> 17:23.359
Desperate?

17:23.640 --> 17:27.530
Oh, but she seems much happier now.

17:27.530 --> 17:28.610
Right...

17:28.610 --> 17:32.450
She's just happy she got herself
a new punching bag.

17:32.770 --> 17:34.740
Sensei! Please come quickly!

17:35.240 --> 17:36.410
What happened?

17:37.070 --> 17:39.870
My friend fell off the roof
while fixing it!

17:40.150 --> 17:42.330
Two others got injured as well.

17:42.330 --> 17:43.750
Got it.

17:43.750 --> 17:45.630
Usato-kun, mind coming with us?

17:45.630 --> 17:47.550
O-Of course not!

17:47.820 --> 17:49.840
Excuse me! Please clear the way!

17:49.840 --> 17:51.470
Over here, Sensei!

17:52.470 --> 17:53.970
Orga-san! What's the plan?

17:57.100 --> 17:59.390
S-Sorry, I forgot...

18:00.350 --> 18:01.520
It's fine, it's fine!

18:01.520 --> 18:02.940
This happens all the time.

18:02.940 --> 18:04.300
Don't worry about it.

18:07.360 --> 18:09.820
We should treat them immediately.

18:09.820 --> 18:12.450
Usato-kun, could I leave him to you?

18:12.690 --> 18:13.830
O-Of course!

18:19.540 --> 18:21.500
Other than myself,

18:21.500 --> 18:24.080
I've only ever healed Orga-san
and Inukami-senpai...

18:24.790 --> 18:28.170
Their injuries weren't critical either.

18:29.050 --> 18:30.800
But if war breaks out...

18:31.180 --> 18:33.800
I will have to treat injuries
even more severe than this

18:33.800 --> 18:35.470
right in the middle of battle.

18:36.470 --> 18:39.890
I knew that's what all
that training was for, but...

18:40.180 --> 18:41.930
Calm down, Usato-kun.

18:44.230 --> 18:47.440
Who you're treating or where you're
treating them doesn't matter.

18:47.440 --> 18:50.610
You have the power to heal them.

18:50.870 --> 18:53.070
All you have to do is to believe...

18:53.070 --> 18:54.530
that you can do it.

18:55.950 --> 18:59.240
Rose-san had complete faith in you.

18:59.740 --> 19:00.950
That's right.

19:00.950 --> 19:03.370
Even Rose believes in me.

19:03.370 --> 19:05.870
I have to believe in myself.

19:06.250 --> 19:08.920
Thank you, Orga-san.

19:23.770 --> 19:26.140
Good job, Usato-kun!

19:26.520 --> 19:28.560
You really saved us there.

19:28.920 --> 19:31.650
Did I really do a good job?

19:31.650 --> 19:33.360
You did a perfect job!

19:33.360 --> 19:36.860
That guy was amazed he couldn't
feel any pain at all, wasn't he?!

19:36.860 --> 19:37.990
H-He was!

19:37.990 --> 19:42.450
I'd appreciate it if you could drop by
to lend a hand when you're free.

19:42.450 --> 19:45.540
It's tough with just the two of us.

19:45.540 --> 19:48.170
No thanks to your lousy constitution!

19:49.190 --> 19:50.840
You don't pull any punches, do you?

19:51.160 --> 19:53.260
S-Sure! I'll be back!

19:53.630 --> 19:55.190
See ya!

19:56.300 --> 19:58.180
Way to go, Onii-chan!

19:58.180 --> 19:59.550
Oh, what's this about?

19:59.550 --> 20:02.260
When you were giving Usato-kun advice?

20:02.260 --> 20:03.890
You were so cool!

20:05.350 --> 20:06.560
You think?

20:07.520 --> 20:08.560
Ururu.

20:08.560 --> 20:11.270
About that letter from Rose-san.

20:14.190 --> 20:17.550
We have been summoned to go to war.

20:18.240 --> 20:20.630
The Demon Lord's Army is close.

20:22.160 --> 20:23.870
The same goes for you,

20:23.870 --> 20:27.830
but Usato-san doesn't have
any experience on the battlefield.

20:28.130 --> 20:30.500
The only thing that he can rely on...

20:30.500 --> 20:33.000
is an absolute confidence
in his own abilities.

20:34.420 --> 20:38.840
I think Rose-san
knows what she's doing.

20:39.240 --> 20:42.350
But I'll do everything I can, too.

20:42.350 --> 20:43.430
I see...

20:44.470 --> 20:45.850
It's starting, isn't it?

20:46.560 --> 20:47.560
War?

20:47.560 --> 20:48.690
Yeah.

20:50.980 --> 20:52.440
Everything will be all right.

20:55.610 --> 20:58.110
I threw in a few extra!

20:58.110 --> 21:00.700
Wow, thank you so much!

21:02.450 --> 21:04.410
Hm... delicious!

21:04.410 --> 21:06.580
Blurin will love these!

21:10.540 --> 21:11.710
Is something wrong?

21:11.710 --> 21:13.390
Are you lost?

21:14.210 --> 21:16.380
You are the only one
who could see it.

21:17.670 --> 21:21.340
That is why this is a future
you can change.

21:57.880 --> 22:01.170
I have done you a great favor.

22:01.170 --> 22:04.390
You now have a duty to repay me.

22:07.560 --> 22:08.640
What?
